{"id":"beziehung","lemma":"Beziehung","pos":"noun","rank":745,"glosses":["relation, relationship, connection","interpersonal relationship, terms, relations","romantic relationship"],"ipa":"/bəˈtsiːʊŋ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/0a/De-Beziehung.ogg/De-Beziehung.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Beziehung","plural":"Beziehungen"},"examples":[{"text":"Diese Beziehung hat keine Zukunft.","en":"This relationship has no future.","words":[{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},null,{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},{"g":"future"}]},{"text":"Menschliche Beziehungen sind kompliziert.","en":"Human relationships are complex.","words":[{"g":"human, manlike","l":"menschlich"},null,{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"complicated, complex"}]},{"text":"Ich denke, unsere Beziehung ist zu Ende.","en":"I think our relationship is over.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to think","l":"denken"},{"g":"our","l":"unser"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,null],"phrases":[[5,7,"finished, through"]]},{"text":"Du musst noch viel über Beziehungen lernen.","en":"You still have a lot to learn about relationships.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to have to","l":"müssen"},{"g":"still / yet"},{"g":"much, a lot"},{"g":"[with accusative or…"},null,{"g":"to learn"}]},{"text":"In welcher Beziehung steht sie zu dir?","en":"What relation is she to you?","words":[{"g":"in"},{"g":"which"},null,{"g":"to stand","l":"stehen"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"}]}]}